{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19933","headline":"南阳公请东樱桃亭子春讌 · 孟郊","name":"南阳公请东樱桃亭子春讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万木皆未秀，一林先含春。\n此地独何力，我公布深仁。\n霜叶日舒卷，风枝远埃尘。\n初英濯紫霞，飞雨流清津。\n赏异出嚣杂，折芳积懽忻。\n文心兹焉重，俗尚安能珍。\n碧玉粧粉比，飞琼穠艳均。\n鸳鸯七十二，花态并相新。\n常恐遗秀志，迨兹广讌陈。\n芳菲争胜引，歌咏竟良辰。\n方知戏马会，永谢登龙宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}